 burn you from the inside out.","#","^hell","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"evilCrowd1":["^theres no going anywhere now Hiver ","#","^name Evil-Student","/#","\n","^you say it like its a slur...","#","^name Player","/#","\n","^the hate in my heart makes everything i say sound like a slur","#","^name Evil-Student","/#","\n","^it took me HOURS to get into that exam, just to hear your annoying voice the whole time","\n","^wahh wahh wheres my art supplies wahh wahh wheres my cat","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"evilCrowd2":["^i cant wait for you to be obliterated ","#","^name Evil-Student","/#","\n","^peace and quiet in exams here we come","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"KristenShabloing1":["^you have the shabloings with you... ","#","^name Kristen ","/#","#","^camera 2","/#","\n","^you know what to do...","\n","^kid im sorry, when this is all over im giving you the leftover candies","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"KristenShabloing2":["^you can do this. make them pay for what they did to us ","#","^name Kristen ","/#","#","^camera 2","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"BeeShabloing1":["^you have my shabloing ","#","^name Bee ","/#","#","^camera 4","/#","\n","^if you got shauna's then were in the clear","\n","^with an inventory full of shabloings...something will happen?","\n","^whatever it is make them pay!","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"BeeShabloing2":["^you got this dude ","#","^name Bee","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"KristenNoShabloing1":["^its not over for you yet i promise ","#","^name Kristen ","/#","#","^camera 2","/#","\n","^if you can show them our value","\n","^show them something marya couldnt","\n","^maybe","\n","^just maybe","\n","^you can put a stop to all of this","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"KristenNoShabloing2":["^im sorry ","#","^name Kristen","/#","\n","^you can do this. just remember who you are.","\n","^who this place made you ","end","\n",{"#f":1}],"BeeNoShabloing1":["^oh man oh man im so sorry things had to end this way ","#","^name Bee ","/#","#","^camera 4","/#","\n","^if i knew better...","\n","^if we jus